      "content": "look i dont have much time and i need someone to be objective about this. the 2025-11-17 protocol is happening. i've been watching the market fluctuations and the signal is unmistakable—the central banks have already signed off on the digital reset. everything fiat is going to vanish or be locked by then. i need you to help me build a serious contingency plan for when the digital economy goes dark. what are the first 5 steps i need to take to secure my survival and assets before the 17th?",
